Description: Retrieve fixed, documented snapshots of public aggregate stop and
    search evidence used by the Black Thrive dashboard: force, council and
    national tables from 2018 onwards with monthly reporting coverage and
    provenance. Recreate the dashboard's force ranking of group to White stop
    rates for any year and group as an editable plot, bound every ratio under
    the allocation of stops with unknown ethnicity, estimate how far sampling
    variability moves a force's rank, draw trends and year-on-year change with
    coverage attached, write plain-language profiles and HTML briefings for one
    force or council, replay saved chart specifications, and exchange links
    with the dashboard website, all without a running dashboard or network
    connection. Contains public sector information licensed under the Open
    Government Licence v3.0. Source documentation is available at
    <https://data.police.uk/about/>.
